Smash your target with a splintering glass attack doing [128%, 152%, 170%, 186%, 200% (TL1-5)] arcane weapon damage.

If this attack hits the target will have glass splinters for 6 turns.

Each turn the target will bleed for 8% of the attack damage. The splinters are very painful and if the target moves it will instantly take [7%, 14%, 20%, 25%, 30% (TL1-5)] of the attack damage.

At level 5 the target suffers so much it has 15% chances to fail using talents.
